{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは(ヽ´ω`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"堀未央奈です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miona.hori/img/blog/miona.hori/img/2013/12/28/3522250/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はバレッタ全国握手会\nin京都でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都めっちゃ好きさかいっ。\n皆さんと沢山お話できて\n凄く楽しかったです♪♪\n3人レーンで琴子、蘭世だったので\n中3組の若い子達に負けずと\n私もはしゃぎましたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も京都で個別握手会\nちなみに髪型はもう決めています♬\n来てくださる方は足元に気をつけて\n温かい格好で来てください！\n楽しみおな(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日初雪をみました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べたくなるな〜\n抹茶かけたいな〜\n雪やこんこ〜\nあられより醤油せんべい〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miona.hori/img/blog/miona.hori/img/2013/12/28/3522250/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピースっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう明日は私の大好きな\n生駒さんの誕生日です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも私の支えになってくださる\n優しいお姉ちゃんです♡\n今日もライブの直前にぎゅーって\nハグしましたξ´๑•ω•๑`Ҙ\n笑いのツボも似ていると思う...笑\n本当におめでとうございます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miona.hori/img/blog/miona.hori/img/2013/12/28/3522250/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また更新します\nおやすみおな(ヽ´ω`)"}],"source":"archive"}